  id: mars
  title: Mars
  subtitle: THE RED PLANET
  paragraph: Iron oxide in the dust gives Mars its colour. It holds Olympus Mons, the largest volcano in the solar system, and a canyon system as long as the United States is wide. Dry riverbeds and buried ice show that water once ran here.
